{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40114,"sections":[{"id":"script-20114","name":"原始脚本 20114","scripts":[20114],"start":0,"count":24}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:0","scriptId":20114,"text":"毕竟是同时对付三路对手，而且在不能使用能力的情况下，兰布达显然不是我们的对手","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:1","scriptId":20114,"text":"“切……没想到还有两下子。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":56,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:2","scriptId":20114,"text":"“才这两下子就不行了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":56,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:3","scriptId":20114,"text":"“哼，只不过稍微沾了点便宜就得意起来了，人类这个种族还真是无药可救了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":56,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:4","scriptId":20114,"text":"“成王败寇，走到哪里都一样。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":56,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:5","scriptId":20114,"text":"（兰布达这家伙比我上次遇到弱不少，是因为在模拟世界的关系吗……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:6","scriptId":20114,"text":"就在这时，兰布达的身体开始慢慢变得稀薄。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:7","scriptId":20114,"text":"“好像有点不对啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:8","scriptId":20114,"text":"这时波西娅突然出现了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:9","scriptId":20114,"text":"“她准备离开这个模拟世界了，反正我也拦不住她，只能这样了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:10","scriptId":20114,"text":"言至于此兰布达的身体由稀薄转为透明，慢慢的消散开去。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:11","scriptId":20114,"text":"看到她完全消散以后，波西娅对着大家宣布。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:12","scriptId":20114,"text":"“这次的征召任务就此结束，所有的数据我都已经统计到了，剩下来的都是分析时间。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:13","scriptId":20114,"text":"“下面我会把大家带回现实世界，请闭上眼睛，不然又要头晕了哟。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:14","scriptId":20114,"text":"“你之前可没说过要闭眼。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:15","scriptId":20114,"text":"“怪不得一直会头晕，我还以为是传送本身的后遗症呢！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":632,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:16","scriptId":20114,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":632,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:17","scriptId":20114,"text":"“啊啦？我没说过吗？真是对不起～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:18","scriptId":20114,"text":"说罢，波西娅打了个响指，整个模拟世界瞬间变得漆黑一片……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:19","scriptId":20114,"text":"转瞬之间已经回到了现实世界，只见波西娅站在研究室的正中央笑着迎接我们。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:21","scriptId":20114,"text":"“那么大家到任务前台找芮蓓领取任务报酬吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:22","scriptId":20114,"text":"“接下来我会进入比较忙的数据整理。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:23","scriptId":20114,"text":"虽然唐突，但任务就是任务，完成以后就没有留恋了，三支队伍纷纷离开了波西娅的实验室。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20114:20114:24","scriptId":20114,"text":"通过这次的模拟数据收集，波西娅又开发出了不少新品种的舞装，不过这都是后话了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
